# About

This blog is about programming, internet, computer science and modern
technologies. Some records made in English. If you’re interested in translation message me.

Blogs posts are divided by context, section called “Blog” is for main articles and posts, and section called “Feed” is for small posts, such as sharing links, and mentions.

## What about me ?

I am full-stack developer with 15+ years experience in software development.

* Today: AI/ML, Rust, Go, Blockchain

* Tomorrow:  Quantum, IoT

* Always: PHP, Ruby, Python, C

* Experienced in modern system architectures and development

* Fluent with linux automation

* Security researcher

## Projects

=>  Ro-Photo

- Static gallery generator with EXIF data

=>  Sortem

- Tab sorter for chrome-based browsers

=>  C-Volley

- Arcade volley game written in C using Raylib

=>  Debloat Web

- A Chrome browser extension that allows you to select and hide any element on web pages. Hidden elements persist across visits to the same website. Make web less bloated for you.

=>  OverLauncher

- A native, less bloated macOS application launcher that provides a fast, searchable interface for finding and launching  installed applications. No telemetry, no ads, pure functionality.

=>  PiePal

- A Python program to fetch and display PayPal transactions and subscription details. The script uses the PayPal REST API to retrieve transactions related to a specific Subscription ID and can display them in a terminal using the rich, - library for a formatted and clean output.

=>  HTTOP

- A real-time HTTP log monitor similar to ApacheTop, written in Rust. This tool allows you to watch incoming http requests in real-time. Purpose - research on web crawlers.

=>  Bry

- Bry - Biorhythms with Rust

=>  LaResume

- LaTeX framework for building CVs

=>  Jekyll Mail Comments

- This gem fetches email from your mailbox by filtering with specific suffix, it makes data files which you can use to generate Jekyll comments.

=>  noroot-awesome-wm

- Theme for AwesomeWM

=>  nginx_status

- nginx webserver module to show network connection status.

